                    <occupation>religious writer</occupation>
                    <occupation>actuary</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>William Frend, religious writer and actuary (1757 - 1841) appears on a number of occasions in the diary and the attribution 
     is reasonably certain. The only complication is that Frend is entered under 1790 in the 1796  list of Godwin's acquaintances, 
     while there seem to be no entries relating to him until 1794. This remains unexplained.  The <title>DNB</title>contains information on 
     Frend in the context of Godwin's circle.</p>
                    </note>
